2. **E02 final-cut WYSIWYG fix** (commits `e7c76d7` + `3bbe597`) — Director's timeline edits never reached the final cut; every re-stitch produced byte-identical renders (4 files v01-v04, same SHA256). ROOT: two APPROVED VID-animatic (v06+v07) and EXEC-STITCH `.find()`'d the stale v06. Fixed + media-versioning + duration-consolidation + ffprobe + music URL decode. Full diagnosis in memory note `session_2026-06-08_e02-finalcut-wysiwyg-fix.md`.

